WEBVTT

00:04:29.555 --> 00:04:32.181
Come on, hands up, who always
gets bitten by mosquitoes?

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.911
And who never gets bitten?

00:04:33.935 --> 00:04:38.101
There's always one or two really
annoying people that never get bitten.

00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:40.689
But the mosquito
has a really hard job to find you,

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:43.260
and that's all to do
with the way you smell.

00:04:43.284 --> 00:04:46.333
People who don't attract
mosquitoes smell repellent,

00:04:46.357 --> 00:04:47.937
and what we know is that --

00:04:47.961 --> 00:04:48.962
(Laughter)

00:04:48.986 --> 00:04:52.206
I should clarify, repellent to mosquitoes,

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.381
not to people.

00:04:53.405 --> 00:04:54.406
(Laughter)

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:55.668
And what we know now

00:04:55.692 --> 00:04:59.718
is that that is actually
controlled by our genes.

00:04:59.742 --> 00:05:01.384
But mosquitoes are able to do that